WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.420
Data is at the center of nearly every product you own,

00:00:03.420 --> 00:00:06.015
your phone, your TV, even your car.

00:00:06.015 --> 00:00:10.320
Products have become increasingly customized to your needs with the help of data.

00:00:10.320 --> 00:00:12.270
Allowing companies like Netflix, Uber,

00:00:12.270 --> 00:00:15.225
and Amazon to build great data-driven products.

00:00:15.225 --> 00:00:17.204
Since every product is data-driven,

00:00:17.204 --> 00:00:21.765
the melding of data science and product management is the future of product development.

00:00:21.765 --> 00:00:23.850
In Udacity's applying data science to

00:00:23.850 --> 00:00:28.350
product management course from the upcoming Data Product Manager Nanodegree Program,

00:00:28.350 --> 00:00:31.200
you'll learn how to build data-driven products backed by

00:00:31.200 --> 00:00:35.235
insightful analysis and understand how to utilize data science,

00:00:35.235 --> 00:00:40.465
machine learning, and artificial intelligence to inform complex product decisions.

00:00:40.465 --> 00:00:45.440
In this course, you'll leverage data tools and techniques including SQL and Tableau to

00:00:45.440 --> 00:00:50.900
analyze and enrich data sets to identify product future opportunities and ultimately,

00:00:50.900 --> 00:00:53.095
create a data product concept.

00:00:53.095 --> 00:00:54.380
At the end of the course,

00:00:54.380 --> 00:00:58.805
you will apply the skills you acquire to complete a real-world project.

00:00:58.805 --> 00:01:00.800
In this project, you will create

00:01:00.800 --> 00:01:03.650
the launch strategy for the first flying car taxi service,

00:01:03.650 --> 00:01:08.550
Flyber in one of the most congested cities in America, New York City.

00:01:08.550 --> 00:01:13.295
Leverage data to build products that position customers and businesses to thrive.

00:01:13.295 --> 00:01:15.500
Get early access to the first course in

00:01:15.500 --> 00:01:21.270
Udacity's upcoming Data Product Manager Nanodegree Program and start learning today.

